----------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The following changes have been made on top of the upstream DeepTutor
codebase (see git history for details):

- Added K12 teaching-engine capabilities (Socratic tutoring, error
  diagnosis, mastery-path tuning) and related prompts.
- Added an Electron desktop shell for packaging the web frontend as a
  PC client (see desktop/).
- Added project documentation (RUN.md, PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md).
- Production account/data integration (see README; storage bridge to
  the XiaoZhi management platform).

Modified files carry a prominent notice in their header stating that
they were changed. See HEADER_TEMPLATE.md for the standard notice.
